# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We dedicate ourselves to making RIAM a welcoming and collaborative project.

## Our Standards
✔ Respect others  
✔ Provide constructive feedback  
✔ Accept corrections gracefully  
✔ Maintain professionalism

🚫 No harassment  
🚫 No discrimination  
🚫 No toxic behavior  

## Enforcement
Violations may result in:
- Temporary or permanent bans  
- Rejection of contributions  

Report issues privately to the maintainers.
